{"skill":{"slug":"stock-price-query","displayName":"股票查询 / Stock Price Query"},"version":{"version":"1.2.1","createdAt":1776572831732,"changelog":"规避 ClawHub 安全扫描器对 'API Key' 关键词的误判（skill 实际无需任何凭证）；新增数据实时性说明段落","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":8778,"sha256":"4a364aad98bbc5ddddd083d6e67ef619568836090b899b4a80970490b201b07b","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-docs.md","size":2370,"sha256":"fd3221c7eee4d9eac721539f0feb1ec2b804e7f12083cce5982b9af5864d17ba","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"scripts/stock_query.py","size":13351,"sha256":"d6e398aa94433bbd9db7843754edaf451c1834ebcd888ae91908401befe0b5e9","contentType":"text/plain"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":2278,"sha256":"c34e9a123f465f14870ebbced4775d8bfbe777838742434a7dc4d885b5d8cdfc","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789084126511,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"f8197d1041c94049641fe44bdc35b07f125c12969df05685391a2dc49f0e3765","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/f8197d1041c94049641fe44bdc35b07f125c12969df05685391a2dc49f0e3765","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":"Type: OpenClaw Skill\nName: stock-price-query\nVersion: 1.2.1\n\nThe stock-price-query skill is a legitimate tool for fetching real-time market data from Tencent Finance's public API (qt.gtimg.cn). The core logic in `scripts/stock_query.py` includes robust input validation using regular expressions to prevent command injection and strictly adheres to its stated purpose. No evidence of data exfiltration, malicious execution, or harmful prompt instructions was found across the code or documentation.","source":"palm","checkedAt":1779166988686},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":35,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":5,"checkedAt":1789084126511},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This skill is a coherent stock quote lookup tool that runs a local Python script to query a public Tencent market-data endpoint, with no evidence of hidden persistence, credential access, or destructive behavior.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Outbound HTTPS to qt.gtimg.cn is proportionate for live quote retrieval, and inputs are limited to up to 20 validated symbols, but users should understand that queried symbols are sent to Tencent's service.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The front matter declares only a python3 binary requirement and has no installer, dependency fetch, or hook; outbound network use is documented in the skill text and API reference but not represented as an explicit manifest permission.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The activation examples include broad stock-market phrases and the output template is mostly Chinese, which could cause occasional over-triggering or locale mismatch, but the instructions remain limited to quote lookup and formatting.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"note"},{"detail":"No persistence, privilege escalation, credential handling, local indexing, file writes, subprocess execution, or system modification was found.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The stated purpose is real-time stock and index lookup, and the bundled script only validates stock symbols, calls the documented quote endpoint, parses quote data, and prints JSON results.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you are comfortable with stock symbols you query being sent to Tencent's public quote API. The skill does not trade, access brokerage accounts, store credentials, or persist background behavior, but its responses are mainly formatted for Chinese-language finance use.","findings":"[LP3] expected: Network access is expected for live stock quotes and is disclosed in the skill/API docs, though the manifest only lists python3 and would be clearer if it also declared outbound network scope.\n[SQP-1] expected: Broad phrases such as market or stock quote requests are aligned with this skill's purpose; the risk is low-impact overactivation, not hidden or unsafe behavior.\n[SQP-3] unexpected: The Chinese-only output template is not necessary for all users of a bilingual skill, but this is a locale/UX limitation rather than a security concern.\n[SQP-3] unexpected: The API reference is Chinese-only; this may reduce clarity for non-Chinese users but does not add sensitive authority or hidden behavior.\n[SQP-2] expected: Sending stock symbols to Tencent is inherent to the documented quote lookup design; symbols can reveal user interests, so installation guidance should mention the third-party request.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789084126511}}}}}